            <h1>Individual Therapy and Counseling</h1>
            <p class="rd-lead">Individual therapy and counseling offers individual support for people in challenging phases of life who want to change their own unhelpful patterns of thinking, feeling and behavior. I am glad to accompany you in looking more closely and developing new paths for yourself.</p>
            <p class="hero-note"><strong>Important note:</strong> My services are not psychotherapy and not medical treatment. In acute crises, please turn to medical or psychotherapeutic services: <a href="{{ '/en/systemische-therapie/' | url }}#faq-krise">Where to turn in acute crises</a>.</p>
